    "description": {
      "value": "<h2>Decisive Momentum</h2><p><em>You do not pause when the fight turns. You ride the turn.</em></p><hr><h3>Rules</h3><p>When you reduce a hostile creature to 0 Integrity or land a critical hit, you may immediately move up to half your movement without provoking reaction strikes <strong>or</strong> make one weapon attack against a different creature within reach. You can use this principle once per round.</p><p class=\"ft-engine-note\"><em>🃏 Card — once per round.</em></p>",
